increase in in pathogenicity

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:20.159
by an antibody dependent enhancement

00:21:18.720 --> 00:21:23.280
type of mechanism? So

00:21:20.159 --> 00:21:24.480
I discussed that a little bit, but

00:21:23.280 --> 00:21:24.960
that's definitely one thing that they're

00:21:24.960 --> 00:21:30.400
actively looking for and trying to avoid.

00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:31.600
So, they know they've seen that in

