previous SARS

00:21:31.600 --> 00:21:36.080
vaccines and animal models. So right

00:21:34.320 --> 00:21:38.480
now we have some

00:21:36.080 --> 00:21:40.159
vaccines that are already in

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:42.640
testing phase in humans.

