00:21:54.480 --> 00:21:59.440
then the body produces the protein.

00:21:56.640 --> 00:22:01.200
So that's one that is again already

00:21:59.440 --> 00:22:02.400
in these phase one safety trials so that

00:22:01.200 --> 00:22:04.000
I guarantee that's one of the

00:22:02.400 --> 00:22:05.440
the things that they will be looking for

00:22:04.000 --> 00:22:08.880
in these volunteers,

00:22:05.440 --> 00:22:11.280
is those types of reactions

00:22:08.880 --> 00:22:12.000
once they re-challenge with the

00:22:11.280 --> 00:22:14.720
vaccine.

00:22:12.000 --> 00:22:16.400
I know the

00:22:14.720 --> 00:22:17.039
vaccine developers are very cognizant of

00:22:16.400 --> 00:22:20.400
that.

